      "ScriptKr": "#title;미식연구회의 기묘한 하루 2",
      "TextJp": "美食研究会の日常（２）",
      "TextCn": "美食研究会的日常（２）",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "",
      "TextJpVoice": ""
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "#na;(선도부 유치장에 갇혀 있는 미식연구회 일당들)",
      "TextJp": "（風紀委員会の留置場に囚われた、美食研究会一同）",
      "TextCn": "（被囚禁在风纪委员会拘留所的，美食研究会一同）",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "",
      "TextJpVoice": ""
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SFX_Emoticon_Motion_Respond",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "5;이즈미;08;뭐어어? 트뤼플? 나도 먹고싶었는데에에에!\n#5;a\n#5;em;[반응]",
      "TextJp": "えええっ！？トリュフ？？私も食べたかったのにいいい！",
      "TextCn": "咦咦咦！？松露？？我明明也想吃的说──！",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0004.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[surprised]えええっ！？[screaming]トリュフ？？[pity]私も食べたかったのに！"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SFX_Emoticon_Motion_Upset",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "1;하루나;05;안타깝게도 뺏겨버렸습니다…….\n#1;a\n#1;em;[속상함]",
      "TextJp": "残念ながら没収されてしまいましたの……。",
      "TextCn": "很遗憾被没收了……",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0005.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[sad]残念ながら没収されてしまいましたの……。"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SE_Cartoon_01",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "",
      "TextJp": "",
      "TextCn": "",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": ""
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "5;이즈미;08;뭐야, 그게!! 너희는 냄새라도 맡았잖아!! 엄청 귀한 거라며!! \n#5;hophop",
      "TextJp": "何よ、もうっ！！みんな匂いぐらいは嗅いだんでしょ！？すっごいレアなんでしょ！？",
      "TextCn": "什么啊，真是的！！大家至少闻到味道了吧！？非常的稀有吧！？",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0007.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[frustrated]何よ、もうっ！！[angry]みんな匂いぐらいは嗅いだんでしょ！？[excited]すっごいレアなんでしょ！？"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "1;하루나;99;그렇습니다. 그 농후하고 독특한 향기…… 평생 잊을 수 없겠죠.\n#1;greeting",
      "TextJp": "はい。あの濃厚で独特な香り……生涯忘れることはないでしょう。",
      "TextCn": "是的。那股浓厚独特的香味……一生都不会忘记吧。",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0008.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[gentle]はい。[dramatic]あの濃厚で独特な香り……生涯忘れることはないでしょう。"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SFX_Emoticon_Motion_Dot",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "1;하루나;05;먹고 싶었는데…… 트뤼플. \n#1;em;[...]",
      "TextJp": "実食したかったですわね……トリュフ。",
      "TextCn": "想实际品尝呢……松露。",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0009.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[soft sigh]実食したかったですわね……[whisper]トリュフ。"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SE_Beat_01",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "",
      "TextJp": "",
      "TextCn": "",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": ""
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "5;이즈미;04;(쾅쾅쾅쾅-!!) 야 이 놈들아!! 니들만 맛있는 거 먹기냐!! #n우리도 나눠줘! 으애애애애-!!\n#5;shake",
      "TextJp": "（ドンドンドンドン！！！）鬼！悪魔！あなたたちだけ美味しいの食べて！\n食べ物の恨みは恐ろしいんだぞ！！\n私にもちょうだいよおおお！うああああん！！",
      "TextCn": "（咚咚咚！！！）魔鬼！恶魔！只有妳们自己吃好吃的！\n食物的怨恨是很恐怖的哦！！\n也分给我啦～～！呜啊啊啊啊！！",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0011.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[screaming]鬼！悪魔！あなたたちだけ美味しいの食べて！\n[angry]食べ物の恨みは恐ろしいんだぞ！！\n[screaming]私にもちょうだいよおお！うああああん！！"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 2314455887,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "#all;hide",
      "TextJp": "",
      "TextCn": "",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": ""
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SFX_Emoticon_Motion_Angry",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "3;이오리;05;시끄럽다!! 유치장 안에서는 정숙하라고!!\n#fontsize;80\n#3;em;[빠직]\n#3;a",
      "TextJp": "おい！！静かにしろ！！",
      "TextCn": "喂！！安静点！！",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0013.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[shouting]おい！！静かにしろ！！"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SFX_Emoticon_Motion_Respond",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "5;치나츠;05;압수한 물품은 일단 범죄에 연루된 게 아닌지 확인한 뒤 돌려드릴 겁니다. #n한 달정도 걸릴 거예요.\n#5;em;[반응]\n#5;al\n#3;m2",
      "TextJp": "没収した物に関しては、犯罪との関連性がないかを調べた後にお返しします。\n1ヶ月くらいで終わるかと。",
      "TextCn": "关于没收的物品，会在调查是否和犯罪有所关联性后归还。\n我想大约是一个月后。",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0014.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[matter-of-fact]没収した物に関しては、犯罪との関連性がないかを調べた後にお返しします。\n[short pause]1ヶ月くらいで終わるかと。"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 4185490626,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "#all;hide",
      "TextJp": "",
      "TextCn": "",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
