    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SFX_Emoticon_Motion_Upset",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "1;하루나;07;한달이면 곤란한데……!!\n#1;stiff\n#1;em;[속상함]\n#1;a",
      "TextJp": "1ヶ月も……！！",
      "TextCn": "要一个月……！！",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0016.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[shocked]1ヶ月も……！！"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SFX_Emoticon_Motion_Respond",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "5;아카리;03;향기라도 맡을래요, 이즈미 씨?\n#5;greeting\n#5;em;[반응]\n#5;a",
      "TextJp": "イズミさん、香りだけでも嗅ぎます？",
      "TextCn": "泉同学，要不要闻闻看香味？",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0017.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[teasing]イズミさん、香りだけでも嗅ぎます？"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SFX_Emoticon_Motion_Sweat",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "1;준코;10;속옷을 건네면서 그런 대사 하지 마……. \n#1;em;[땀]\n#1;a",
      "TextJp": "下着を手渡しながらそのセリフっ……！",
      "TextCn": "拿出内裤说着那种台词……！",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0018.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[panicked]下着を手渡しながらそのセリフっ……！"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "5;이즈미;05;이게 뭔데? 네 팬티 같은 건 흥미 없다고, 아카리.",
      "TextJp": "何これ？アカリのパンツに興味はないけど……。",
      "TextCn": "这是什么？我对亚伽里的内裤可没有兴趣……",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0019.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[confused]何これ？アカリのパンツに興味はないけど……。"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "1;아카리;02;모르시는 말씀. 이 속옷으로 말할 거라면…… 무려 그 트뤼플을 감쌌던 것입니다.",
      "TextJp": "あら、もったいない。これはですね……あのトリュフを包んでいた下着ですよ？",
      "TextCn": "啊啦真浪费。这是啊……包着那朵松露的内裤唷？",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0020.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[teasing]あら、もったいない。[playful]これはですね……あのトリュフを包んでいた下着ですよ？"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SE_FootStep_03a",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "",
      "TextJp": "",
      "TextCn": "",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": ""
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SFX_Emoticon_Motion_Twinkle",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "1;아카리;03;검은 다이아몬드라고 불리는 그 버섯의 향기가 그대로 여기 남아있다고요☆\n#1;em;[반짝]",
      "TextJp": "黒いダイヤと呼ばれるあのキノコの香りが、この下着に染み込んでいるんです☆",
      "TextCn": "被称作黑色钻石的那朵蘑菇的香味，浸染在了这条内裤上☆",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0022.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[playful tone]黒いダイヤと呼ばれるあのキノコの香りが、この下着に染み込んでいるんです。"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SFX_Emoticon_Motion_Exclaim",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "#all;hide\n3;이즈미;09;줘! 맡을래!\n#3;closeup\n#3;em;[!]",
      "TextJp": "ちょうだい！嗅ぐ！",
      "TextCn": "给我！我要闻！",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0023.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[excited]ちょうだい！[excited tone]嗅ぐ！"
    },
    {
