      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "1;준코;11;여긴 제정신인 녀석은 없는 거냐…….\n#1;em;[땀]\n#1;ar\n#3;m5",
      "TextJp": "ここにまともな人はいないの……？",
      "TextCn": "这里就没有正经的人吗……？",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0031.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[sigh]ここにまともな人はいないの……？"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SFX_Emoticon_Motion_Twinkle",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "#3;hide\n5;하루나;02;과연. 맛을 위해서 공부하는 모습이 아름답습니다. 이즈미 씨.\n#5;em;[반짝]\n#5;greeting",
      "TextJp": "さすがですわね。味に対する飽くなきその姿勢、お見事ですわ、イズミさん。",
      "TextCn": "果然厉害呢。对于味道完全不厌烦的身姿，真是完美，泉同学。",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0032.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[elegant tone]さすがですわね。[proud]味に対する飽くなきその姿勢、お見事ですわ、イズミさん。"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "1;준코;11;아니…… 누가 봐도 기분나쁜 변태의 모습이거든…….",
      "TextJp": "いや……どこからどう見ても立派な変態だけど……。",
      "TextCn": "不……无论怎么看都是出色的变态吧……",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0033.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[deadpan]いや……[annoyed]どこからどう見ても立派な変態だけど……。"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "[s] \"안녕, 모두들.\"",
      "TextJp": "[s]\"や、みんな。\"",
      "TextCn": "[s]「嗨，各位。」",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "",
      "TextJpVoice": ""
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SFX_Emoticon_Motion_Surprise",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "5;하루나;07\n1;준코;10;우왓?! 깜짝이야! 선생님?! #n언제부터 있었던 거야?!\n#1;em;[?!]\n#1;shake",
      "TextJp": "うわっ！ビックリしたあ！\nいつからそこにいたの、先生？",
      "TextCn": "唔哇！吓死我了！\n你什么时候在那里的，老师？",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0035.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[surprised]うわっ！ビックリしたあ！\n[confused]いつからそこにいたの、先生？"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SFX_Emoticon_Motion_Question",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "5;아카리;04;어머, 선생님은 여기 왜 계신 거예요?\n#5;em;[?]",
      "TextJp": "あら、なぜ先生がこちらに？",
      "TextCn": "啊啦，为什么老师会在这里？",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0036.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[surprised]あら、[confused]なぜ先生がこちらに？"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "1;하루나;07;분명 또 이상한 짓을 하다가 잡혀온 거겠죠. 정말이지 질리지도 않는 분입니다.",
      "TextJp": "大方また変なことでもして捕まったのでしょう。まったく、懲りないお方ですわ。",
      "TextCn": "肯定是又做了什么奇怪的事被逮捕了吧。真是的，不长记性的人呢。",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0037.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[sigh]大方また変なことでもして捕まったのでしょう。[soft sigh]まったく、懲りないお方ですわ。"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "[s1] \"아냐! 누명을 쓰고 갇혀 있는거라구! 난 억울해!\"\n[s2] \"말하자면 길어…….\"",
      "TextJp": "[s1]\"違う！濡れ衣！冤罪！\"\n[s2]\"話すと長くて……。\"",
      "TextCn": "[s1]「不是！冤枉！冤罪！」\n[s2]「说来话长……」",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "",
      "TextJpVoice": ""
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 1102,
      "SelectionGroup": 1,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "SFX_Emoticon_Motion_Heart",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "5;아카리;03;다른 사람도 아닌 선생님이 그런 말씀 하니까 엄청 신뢰가 안가는데요☆\n#5;em;[하트]\n#5;greeting",
      "TextJp": "先生がそのように仰っても、全っ然信憑性ありませんね☆",
      "TextCn": "就算老师那么说，也完全没有可信度呢☆",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/group/1102/lines/0039.mp3",
      "TextJpVoice": "[playful]先生がそのように仰っても、[teasing]全っ然信憑性ありませんね。"
    },
